      "notes": "PlayerSanity.NetworkedUpdatePlayerSanity's own direct store -- the two other Maximum Sanity patches only cover ChangeSanity's two overloads. This site writes an authoritative network-synced value straight to +0x30, bypassing both, whenever you're in a hosted/joined multiplayer lobby. Found via write-watch after a report that sanity still drained to ~0 with the first two patches active -- confirmed the field held before checking, and only sees this method after the fact."
